      "raw_mention": "$MITK",
      "text": "AI agents are already accessing bank accounts and trying to move money, per Axios.\n\nBanks are scrambling to restrict them. Could be a pretty interesting setup for some of the smaller cyber names.\n\n$OSPN already serves more than 60% of the world's 100 largest banks, according to its investor deck.\n\nThey already sell those banks authentication and transaction security. Now add agents logging in, buying things and making payments for customers.\n\nThe bank has to know who gave the agent access, what it's allowed to do, and which transactions still need the customer's approval.\n\nI think banks could end up spending a lot more on this as agent use grows. $OSPN already has relationships with many of the banks that would be buying.\n\n$MITK, $YOU and a few others are also names I like here.\n\nDisclosure: I'm long $OSPN.",
